UBS Parallel Passages Database
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
File: data/parallel-passages.json

Derived from the UBS Parallel Passages Database by the United Bible
Societies, published at https://github.com/ubsicap/ubs-open-license
("parallel passages/ParallelPassages.xml").

Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes: converted from XML to JSON by tools/parallel-passages/generate.py.
Each word score is restated as a match strength (no_match, partial, full);
the source's line-break component is discarded; range and comma references
are expanded to verses; and each member names the edition its scores are
counted in, with Hebrew members of mixed groups mapped to the Septuagint
numbering. The derived file is distributed under the same CC BY-SA 4.0
licence.

